# Terminology

The words this repository uses precisely, and what each one means here. The page has two
parts: the vocabulary every game rendered from the template shares, such as managed
file, seed file, port, fake, restatement and quality gate; and a short table of the
terms {{ game_name }} introduces itself, which grows as the game's own specifications
name new things.
